## 🔍 关键数据流向分析

### 前端到后端的数据传输
```
Frontend Form Data:
{
  name: "我的知识库",
  kbType: "local"  // 新增的知识库类型字段
}

↓ HTTP POST /v1/kb/create

Backend Request Body:
{
  name: "我的知识库",
  kb_type: "local",  // 映射到后端参数
  id: "uuid-generated-id",
  tenant_id: "user-tenant-id", 
  created_by: "user-id",
  embd_id: "tenant-embedding-model"
}

↓ Database Insert

Knowledgebase Table:
- id: "uuid-generated-id" (PK)
- name: "我的知识库"
- tenant_id: "user-tenant-id"
- created_by: "user-id" 
- embd_id: "tenant-embedding-model"
- status: "1" (valid)
- 其他字段使用默认值...
```

